    Knowledge: the sixth judgement round's defect
    
    Only a folder that is not there is gone: a folder under knowledge/ that cannot
    be looked at or listed refuses the command, and rebuild no longer forgets the
    rows of repositories still on the disk.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>

